  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Kaiwen visits Unit Two to ask them to swap out the feuding commentators, gets angrily shown the door, and talks over the standoff with Xingzi back at Unit One. Listen to their Mandarin dialogue first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "文娱论现在本来就是一部监制，哪儿来的偷方案啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "只是淳于总觉得这个方案有点风险。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他建议还是不要让那两位评论员同台出现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "本来这次让二部听咱们指挥，他们心里就挺不乐意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "现在又让他们最得意的方案换人，关系越闹越僵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我都调查过了，这两个人最近没啥大问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要不先这样吧，有些事别太较真。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你有本事当着老大的面说呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "喂，红毯不用那两位评论员了是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行，我知道了，谢谢！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "文娱论现在本来就是一部监制，哪儿来的偷方案啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Entertainment Talk is under Unit One's supervision now, so how is that stealing a plan?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "只是淳于总觉得这个方案有点风险。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao simply feels this proposal carries some risk.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他建议还是不要让那两位评论员同台出现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He advises against having those two commentators appear onstage together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "本来这次让二部听咱们指挥，他们心里就挺不乐意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Having Unit Two take orders from us already left them unhappy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "现在又让他们最得意的方案换人，关系越闹越僵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Making them change their proudest plan now only makes relations stiffer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我都调查过了，这两个人最近没啥大问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I checked into it, and those two have had no big trouble lately.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "要不先这样吧，有些事别太较真。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe let it be for now; some things need not be pushed too hard.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你有本事当着老大的面说呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you are so brave, go say that to our boss's face!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "喂，红毯不用那两位评论员了是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, so the red carpet is dropping those two commentators?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行，我知道了，谢谢！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Great, got it, thank you!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
